{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>The quails.</b> A species of bird, and very fat (Yoma 75)." "<b>And a layer of dew came down.</b> The dew lay upon the manna, and in another place it says (Numbers 11) ״וּבְרֶדֶת הַטַּל וְגוֹ׳״ — the dew descends upon the ground, and the manna descends upon it, and again dew descends upon it — so it is as though placed in a box (Yoma, there)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:38.985123479Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}